      "message": "* **Missing Header File / Manual Forward Declarations:** `updater.cc` manually forward-declares `BuildFtCmd` and `SendBulkCommand`. This violates the DRY principle and bypasses the compiler\u0027s ability to catch signature mismatches. If `ft_scsi.cc` changes its interface, `updater.cc` will fail at link-time rather than compile-time.  \n    \n* *Suggestion:* Create an `ft_scsi.h` header file containing these declarations and `#include` it in both `ft_scsi.cc` and `updater.cc`.",
