      "message": "To safely parse the integer without relying on null-termination, you should replace `std::atoi` with `std::from_chars`.\n\nBecause a `std::string_view` simply points to a segment of memory and a length, calling `.data()` on it does not guarantee a null character `\\0` at the end of that segment. If `args[1]` is ever derived from a larger, un-terminated buffer, `std::atoi` will read out of bounds.",
